  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.7 (forks 2.3.12) - Blazor WebAssembly AOT: loading a kernel with 6 or more parameters through the stream loaders on WebGPU, WebGL or Wasm no longer kills the .NET runtime (Mono could not create the launcher delegate); they now launch with boxed arguments (Accelerator.SupportsBoxedLaunch, Kernel.LaunchBoxed). Hybrid GPU machines pick the discrete GPU (DevicePreference, context.GetBestDevice). Group.BarrierPopCount/And/Or fixed on WebGPU, Wasm and CPU. Native f16 and subgroup selection follow the device. See CHANGELOG.md.",
